Hey Touma... Eh?

00:22:56.560 --> 00:22:59.390
Why are there 3 of the same cup?

00:23:00.600 --> 00:23:02.770
That's great.

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:06.650
The cups that we bought extra found themselves new owners.

00:23:08.400 --> 00:23:09.990
Speaking of which.

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:13.910
Haruka's and Chiaki's cups...

00:23:23.080 --> 00:23:25.170
...are both nice.

00:23:25.170 --> 00:23:27.420
Anyone want to trade with me?

00:23:27.420 --> 00:23:31.010
You should have chosen properly at the start, dumbass!

00:23:31.680 --> 00:23:32.720
Haruka-san is...

00:23:32.720 --> 00:23:33.680
Haruka-san's...

00:23:33.680 --> 00:23:34.680
Haruka-san had...

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:35.930
Mako-chan are you all right?

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:36.890
Are you feeling okay?

00:23:36.890 --> 00:23:37.850
Your face is red.

00:23:37.850 --> 00:23:38.890
Do you have a fever?

00:23:38.890 --> 00:23:40.390
I'm fine.

00:23:40.390 --> 00:23:42.560
Next time on Minami-ke Okaeri.

00:23:42.560 --> 00:23:43.600
That's a violation.
